  "title": "Validate with Facts",
  "description": "Challenge statements you want to believe: - Find counterexamples: Look for cases where the statement doesn’t apply. - Separate desire from reality: Ask, \"Do I want this to be true, or is it actually true?\" - Test coincidences: Check if perceived patterns have a logical basis. Example: Horoscope says, \"You’ll have a lucky day.\" Ask yourself if you’re noticing \"luck\" because you expect it or if events genuinely align.",
